course: dictionary
lesson: 4446
title: Handwritten
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Handwritten means written by hand, with a pen or pencil, not typed on a keyboard or printed by a machine. Look at the two parts: hand and written. The writing comes from a person's own hand.
explain: «Timbuktu in Mali had schools and libraries, and many of its old handwritten books still survive.» The words around handwritten give clues. Books that survive are books that have lasted a long time, so the handwritten books were written out by people, not printed.
explain: Always ask: what word would fit here? Put your meaning into the sentence and check it. «Many of its old books written by hand still survive» makes sense, so handwritten must mean written by hand.
fact: Handwritten means written by hand with a pen or pencil.
fact: Handwritten is the opposite of typed or printed.
fact: «A handwritten note» and «a handwritten letter» are written by a person themselves.
fact: A handwritten card can feel personal and kind, because someone wrote every word.
fact: Handwritten is an adjective; it can also be the past form of the rare verb «handwrite».
exercise: «Many of its old handwritten books still survive.» What does handwritten mean here? | Painted in bright colours | Printed on a big machine | *Written by hand, not printed | Typed on a computer
exercise: Which of these is handwritten? | A typed homework sheet | A text message on a phone | A printed poster | *A birthday card with a message written in pen
exercise: The detective compared the handwriting on the note. Which phrase means written with a pen, not typed? | A digital sign | A typed email | A printed label | *A handwritten note
test: Mia wrote a handwritten letter to her gran. What does handwritten tell you about the letter? | It was printed in an office | It was sent by email | *She wrote it herself with a pen | It was typed by a computer
test: Which word is closest in meaning to handwritten? | *Written by hand | Digital | Typed | Printed
exam: «Handwritten» means what? | Typed on a keyboard | Printed by a machine | Painted on a wall | *Written by hand with a pen or pencil
